    "detailed_description": "Say hello (morning!) to a new kind of rhythm game, and hang out in a virtual space with Kizuna AI!<br><br>\u25a0Game Overview<br>Kizuna AI: Touch the Beat is a rhythm game that features Kizuna AI.<br>Play in VR mode, or in a non-VR mode that does not require a VR headset.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/cf43c400f1c0edddda8a22a79e777e23.poster.avif?t=1700552282\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/cf43c400f1c0edddda8a22a79e777e23.webm?t=1700552282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/cf43c400f1c0edddda8a22a79e777e23.mp4?t=1700552282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This edition also includes a View Mode, which lets you travel through the game's stages free as a bird.If you want to hang out with Kizuna AI in VR, Kizuna AI: Touch the Beat is for you!<br><br>\u25a0VR Compatible<br>This game can be played on both your PC monitor and with SteamVR.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/bffe169d2dc16ee7a459d4589d63cfe2.poster.avif?t=1700552282\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/bffe169d2dc16ee7a459d4589d63cfe2.webm?t=1700552282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/bffe169d2dc16ee7a459d4589d63cfe2.mp4?t=1700552282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u25a0Steam Deck Compatible<br>The rhythm portion of this game supports touch controls, and the View Mode supports both touch and gyro controls.<br><br>\u25a0Songs &amp; DLC<br>Includes 15 popular songs performed by Kizuna AI, including her massive hit &quot;Hello, Morning,&quot; which has garnered over 2,170,000 views.<br>Post-launch DLC is in the works, including additional songs and outfits, and other content.<br><br>\u25a0Product Specifications<br>Available Languages: Japanese, English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, French",
    "about_the_game": "Say hello (morning!) to a new kind of rhythm game, and hang out in a virtual space with Kizuna AI!<br><br>\u25a0Game Overview<br>Kizuna AI: Touch the Beat is a rhythm game that features Kizuna AI.<br>Play in VR mode, or in a non-VR mode that does not require a VR headset.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/cf43c400f1c0edddda8a22a79e777e23.poster.avif?t=1700552282\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/cf43c400f1c0edddda8a22a79e777e23.webm?t=1700552282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/cf43c400f1c0edddda8a22a79e777e23.mp4?t=1700552282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This edition also includes a View Mode, which lets you travel through the game's stages free as a bird.If you want to hang out with Kizuna AI in VR, Kizuna AI: Touch the Beat is for you!<br><br>\u25a0VR Compatible<br>This game can be played on both your PC monitor and with SteamVR.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/bffe169d2dc16ee7a459d4589d63cfe2.poster.avif?t=1700552282\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/bffe169d2dc16ee7a459d4589d63cfe2.webm?t=1700552282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168240/extras/bffe169d2dc16ee7a459d4589d63cfe2.mp4?t=1700552282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u25a0Steam Deck Compatible<br>The rhythm portion of this game supports touch controls, and the View Mode supports both touch and gyro controls.<br><br>\u25a0Songs &amp; DLC<br>Includes 15 popular songs performed by Kizuna AI, including her massive hit &quot;Hello, Morning,&quot; which has garnered over 2,170,000 views.<br>Post-launch DLC is in the works, including additional songs and outfits, and other content.<br><br>\u25a0Product Specifications<br>Available Languages: Japanese, English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, French",
